            </button>
            <div class="acc__panel">
              <div class="acc__media">
                <img
                  src="/assets/img/home-remedium-range.jpg"
                  alt="ReMedium regenerative treatment"
                />
                <ul class="acc__chips">
                  <li>
                    <b>ReMedium Sub-Q</b
                    ><span>Cheeks, temples &amp; jawline contouring</span>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    <b>ReMedium Mid</b
                    ><span>Lips, chin &amp; nasolabial folds</span>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    <b>ReMedium Fine</b
                    ><span>Superficial lines, crow's feet &amp; neck</span>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="acc">
            <button class="acc__head">
              <span class="acc__no">02.</span>
              <span class="acc__title">Ophthalmic HA Solutions (HA Filler)</span>
              <span class="acc__desc"
                >Specialized medical-grade hyaluronic acid formulated strictly
                for ophthalmic surgical procedures.</span
